t":"根據品格聚光燈，下列關於「特質」的敘述，何者最符合？","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"特質沒有好壞，但是需要找到適合發揮的舞台","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們不需要刻意隱藏自己的特質，要大方展現","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"某個特質如果帶來困擾，就代表那不是好特質","n":20,"ssz":".1.............1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們可以改變自己的特質，來符合他人的期待","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜190字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"191~220字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞221字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（六    )開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":91,"ssz":"..................................................................1.......1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.judge_signature_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判簽名:","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阿翔就是這樣，總是容易懷疑自己，也更容易把一點點","n":24,"ssz":".....................2.."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2._總表_第六大題標題","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"品格力──特質的多元樣貌","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每個人都有自己的特質，而每種特質都有適合的舞台。本文主角阿翔比較內向、自省，因此容易焦慮和想很多，這樣的特質可以幫助他更細心、準備更周到；但有時也讓他太擔心、太緊張。所以，理解一個人的特質時，不能只做好、壞的判斷，而是要看見它在什麼情況下能幫一個人發揮潛力，什麼時候又會變成限制、需要調整。現在就讓我們一起來練習看見特質的多元樣貌！","n":166,"ssz":".1.........................1........1.......1............................................1................................1............................2.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎認識特質的多元樣貌：每一種看似令人困擾的特質，可能有著隱藏的「超能力」。請發揮你的觀察力，試著將左邊的「困擾特質」與右邊對應的「隱藏超能力」連起來，找出它們真實的模樣吧！","n":86,"ssz":"............2.................................................1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].left_header","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"困擾特質","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].right_header","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"隱藏超能力","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].left.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想太多","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].left.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"固執","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].left.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"衝動","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].left.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"愛說話","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].left.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"好勝、愛比較","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].left.6","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沒主見","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].right.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"行動力強、反應快","n":8,"ssz":"......1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].right.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"隨和、配合性高","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].right.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"充滿鬥志、認真投入","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].right.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"心思細膩，做事謹慎","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].right.E","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"口條流暢、能表達","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].right.F","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有恆心、能堅持","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"連線（圖形）；5 條紅色 srgb C00000 + 1 條黑色虛線（1→D 那條），文字流無此資訊","n":50,"ssz":".................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→特質是一體兩面，當看見令人困擾的特質時，也可以換個角度找找它隱藏的超能力唷！","n":39,"ssz":"....2....................1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"特質伸展台","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎特質伸展台：不同的特質在適合的情境下才能展現「超能力」，讓特質成為優勢。請依據特質判斷，哪一個情境更適合發揮？請在（ ）打勾。","n":64,"ssz":"...............................................1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"特質","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"情境(適合發揮的打勾)","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section